     "p": {
      "ar": "`await Promise.all(list.map(...))` بيبعت الطلبات كلها مرة واحدة. أسرع، بس ممكن يكسر الـ rate limit. قسّم لمجموعات صغيرة.",
      "en": "`await Promise.all(list.map(...))` sends every request at once. Faster, but it can break the rate limit. Split into small batches."
     },
     "ex": "for (const group of chunks(ids, 5)) {\n  await Promise.all(group.map(fetchOne));\n}"
